# Branch ticket prefixes for repos whose work is tracked in GitHub issues.
# Branches are named <PREFIX>-<issue number>/<slug>, so issue #123 in omnibus
# becomes OMNI-123/some-slug. Read by the global git hooks in ./hooks.
#
# Repos absent from this list have no GitHub prefix — their branches use a Jira
# key (ADA-123/...) or the u/sloan/<feature> fallback, and the hooks stay out of
# the way. Add a row when a new repo starts tracking work in GitHub issues.
#
# <repo name>   <PREFIX>
omnibus         OMNI
dotfiles        DOT
